!Proposed Definitions (not finished yet)
<!-- The aleph is aleph symbol, U+2135, not the letter aleph, U+05D0. -->
;__xo__: question word to which the answer is a number
;__ci'i__: infinity; when followed by a number, denotes a transfinite cardinal, such as ℵ<sub>0</sub>, or a transfinite ordinal, such as ℵ<sub>0</sub>.